    "Name": "Minotaur",
    "Details": "Developed by The Society, this variant of the Minotaur uses five Extended Jump Jets and a Magnetic Clamp system to travel around the battlefield. It's equipped with an Improved Heavy Medium Laser, making it a threat to many units.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Resilient</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.984</color></b>",
